	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE: DAISY CHAIN (SLUSE81F 10.1.4, Fig. 10-3, p.205-206)\n1. P/N pairs short, straight, same layer, parallel, length matched.\n2. R_TERM + 220 pF at U1 pins 40-43 -> CVSS. Values per Table 8-5 /\n   Fig. 8-9 (p.198).\n3. Transformer close to its connector; keep-out (no traces, no planes) around\n   daisy-chain parts on ALL layers.\n4. Barrier between transformer pin rows (1-3 | 4-6): 7.11 mm pad gap per\n   Bourns SM91502ALA layout; no copper under body; cable side >= 3 mm to\n   everything (FSAE EV.7.5.7 300-600 V row).\n5. Same transformer PN on both ends of every link (TI SLVAEP4 5.1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
